ACKNOWLEDGMENTS AND CREDITS
================================================================================

This project is the result of collaborative efforts from multiple contributors:

ORIGINAL THEORY AND CONCEPT
- Minvokin Grabiel Xavier (Mr.MR) - Creator and founder of the SPC
  (Super Planet Crypting) theory. The philosophical and mathematical
  foundation of this system was developed by Mr.MR.

ARCHITECTURE RESTORATION AND RECONSTRUCTION
- SGM (Simple Gray Modules) - System architecture analysis, restoration,
  and reconstruction of the original SPC theory.
- KOT/CAT STUDIOS - System architecture analysis, restoration, and
  reconstruction.

DEVELOPMENT AND OPTIMIZATION
- Open Source Community - Web implementation, optimization, and Vietnamese
  localization.
- AI Tools - Supplementary code assistance, debugging support, and
  performance optimization.

TESTING AND QUALITY ASSURANCE
- Testing Team - Real-world testing, bug detection, and issue reporting.
- Idea Contributors - Innovation in restoration and optimization strategies.
- Quality Monitors - Error verification and validation oversight.

